    "id": "pasos",
    "titulo": "Lo que viene ahora",
    "html": "<section id=\"pasos\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#FAF6EE;color:#211714;font-family:Figtree, Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:72px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Próximos pasos</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:72px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-2px\">Lo que viene ahora</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:0px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1\">28 OCT</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;background:#ABC7FF;border:6px solid #211714;border-radius:50%\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;height:6px;background:#211714\"></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:0px 28px 0px 0px\"><h3 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.15\">Briefing</h3><p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;color:#4A3F3A\">Validamos objetivos, pilares, tono e ideas con Barkita.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1\">29–31 OCT</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;background:#FFC184;border:6px solid #211714;border-radius:50%\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;height:6px;background:#211714\"></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:0px 28px 0px 0px\"><h3 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.15\">Accesos y material</h3><p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;color:#4A3F3A\">Cuenta de Instagram, logos, tipografías y fotos o vídeos disponibles.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;color:#8A7F79\">POR FIJAR</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;background:#C5F1AB;border:6px solid #211714;border-radius:50%\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;height:6px;background:#211714\"></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:0px 28px 0px 0px\"><h3 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.15\">Primer rodaje</h3><p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;color:#4A3F3A\">Grabamos el mes con producto de todas las familias.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1\">2 NOV</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;background:#FCC1F1;border:6px solid #211714;border-radius:50%\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;height:6px;background:#211714\"></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:0px 28px 0px 0px\"><h3 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.15\">Primer reel</h3><p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;color:#4A3F3A\">Arranca la publicación: lunes, miércoles y viernes.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1\">FIN DE NOV</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;background:#DDACFB;border:6px solid #211714;border-radius:50%\"></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:0px 28px 0px 0px\"><h3 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.15\">Primer informe</h3><p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;color:#4A3F3A\">Resultados, aprendizajes y ajustes para diciembre.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:14px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#FFFFFF;padding:28px 32px;border-radius:28px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:32px;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;padding:0px 12px 0px 0px\">Necesitamos:</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;background:#ABC7FF;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:999px\">Acceso a Instagram</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;background:#FFC184;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:999px\">Logos y tipografías</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;background:#C5F1AB;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:999px\">Producto para grabar</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;background:#FCC1F1;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:999px\">Una persona que apruebe</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"/pitch/barkita/logo-h-cacao.png\" alt=\"Barkita\" style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:66px;width:150px;height:24px;object-fit:contain\">\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:300px;bottom:62px;width:900px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;color:#6B5F58\">Briefing estratégico · Maen Studios × Barkita</p>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;right:128px;bottom:62px;width:120px;text-align:right;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2\">15</p>\n</section>"
